 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2374  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2374) 'An interpreted timing reported as the result would hide the translated speed. A script that
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2374  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2374) 'does not compile has no fallback to hide behind.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2374  1 LINE
 Text:Written

