2026-10-31T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2374) '- Everything that runs in godot-sandbox is binary-translated, guest ELFs and SafeGDScript
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2374  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2374) '  alike, and an interpreted timing is never the one reported.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2374  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2374) '- No `.gd` ships: every script, third-party ones included, ships compiled as `.sgd` with its
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2374  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2374) '  translation, and a script that does not compile is a counted FAIL, not a fallback.
